# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Runtime state: fragment store, statistics database, and their WAL sidecars.
# `data/` is the default when no configuration says otherwise, so it appears the
# first time anyone runs the binary.
/data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Local configuration, which usually carries an upstream key
/kompressor.toml
/config.toml
*.local.toml
.env
.env.*

# Benchmark output: recorded runs and corpora are regenerated, not committed.
# The corpus and baseline that the tests need are under fixtures/ and are
# deliberately not ignored.
#
# `runs/` is where `scripts/harbor/suite.sh` writes by default
# (`KOMPRESSOR_RUNS`, falling back to `$ROOT/runs`). The codex sweep and
# `scripts/smoke.sh` write outside the checkout entirely — `$HOME/.cache` and
# `mktemp -d` — so neither needs a rule here.
# Unanchored: a run directory is also written wherever KOMPRESSOR_RUNS points,
# which is often a sibling of the repo checkout rather than its root.
runs/
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.gz
!fixtures/*.jsonl
!fixtures/*.jsonl.gz

# Python tooling. `scripts/` is a package-less pile of executables, so importing
# one (which the benchmark tooling does) leaves a __pycache__ beside it holding
# .pyc files named after whatever the script was called at the time — stale and
# misleading the moment anything is renamed.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Claude Desktop compression check: per-run state. The planted token must stay
# unseen by the session under test, and start-ms only scopes one run's stats.
# Experiment directories from prepare.py live outside the checkout (/tmp).
/scripts/claude-desktop-experiment/kd-check/.check/expected-token.txt
/scripts/claude-desktop-experiment/kd-check/.check/start-ms

# Agent tooling state. Serena writes a per-project symbol cache and config here
# the first time it activates on the repo; its own .gitignore covers only
# `cache/` and `project.local.yml`, so `project.yml` would otherwise be
# committed. Nothing in it is needed to build or test — deleting it just makes
# Serena re-index.
.serena/

# Editors and OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# Review output, not part of the project
findings.md

#experiments

scripts/claude-desktop-experiment
docs/investigations/
